# A shower drifts across the corner: the sky greys where it is, the ground darkens, and a
# rainbow follows a long enough one by day.
set season summer
set clock day
set weather natural
set camera 30 30 0.5
wait 30
shot shots/shower_before.png
set shower now
fast 400 raining yes
fast 25
wait 2
expect raining yes
shot shots/shower_during.png
fast 600 raining no
fast 30 event rainbow yes
wait 120
shot shots/shower_after.png
quit
